> e,drop garlic,w
You walk east.

Squeaky Room
You are a small room. Strange squeaky sounds may be heard coming from the passage at the west end. You may also escape to the south.

The clove of garlic falls to the ground.

You walk west. A deranged giant vampire bat (a reject from WUMPUS) swoops down from his belfry and lifts you away....

You are in a non-descript part of a coal mine.
